    changed) but is the same defect class at large; a future full-site pass
    should audit it broadly rather than patch sync.go in isolation.

VERDICT RATIONALE
  The template hunk itself (Check 1a/1b) is clean and correctly mirrors the
  cited sibling pattern. The FAIL is Check 1c: the task's new server-side
  guard logic, which exists specifically to serve the new form this task
  added, funnels its two new failure conditions (400 missing fields, 409
  conflict) through a rendering primitive that a real, traced render +
  real, traced client-side code confirms never reaches the DOM — a full
  ACCESSIBILITY.md #5 failure, not a partial one (no announcement AND no
  visible text), on new-content code paths.
